WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.400
Analog read turns the voltage into a number.

2
00:00:04.126 --> 00:00:07.001
Halfway gives five hundred and twelve.

3
00:00:07.627 --> 00:00:12.752
Zero to three point three volts becomes zero to one thousand and twenty three.

4
00:00:13.781 --> 00:00:16.581
The number is a scale, not the volts.
